ue,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["035abb45-d464-56f3-8858-e97c8e8255c9","5b6992f8-b306-553e-a1fc-610b68d48829","fb7fe950-df30-526d-a950-ac8267d25505","32d5e25f-f3f6-5b10-af71-689ab8b86a85","aceaf53e-9207-5b4c-b436-97e91f940b37","21673ed2-67c7-5db9-b91b-923796a2bc49","5ee17084-41d0-5675-8bee-1d49c9f5857e","96e22a7d-430a-5ed0-9c8b-e2d73a1a1719","40507d74-fe53-5eae-a7e7-1443120af4b3","a6a04dbd-c195-5393-850d-8bbf9c84df89","fea9ab05-3c45-5345-845e-cff256a6c92d","59e8f1b7-d54b-5855-83d2-90234ef08143","8aa4fdf7-9cdf-5ed3-9405-ed819f66b7b3","d28fd30d-9fc1-5dae-83f4-bdde6eecf1ac","f1e344b7-ba63-5955-bdb5-33a272b0d1a6","0cbe6dc7-cf01-5396-9375-34b48eae95d1","0b0e9859-d47e-58d4-99f0-6f5f2f40e175","8750138c-a000-5fd0-9c73-31580f87f284"]},{"name":"harvested","origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"color":0,"uuid":"12161a42-0e12-51e5-a936-1fa5389f224a","export":true,"mirror_uv":false,"isOpen":false,"locked":false,"visibility":false,"autouv":0,"rotation":[0,0,0],"children":["a960423c-1a19-5b82-8e73-aa78e5cd46ac","8d3d7dc1-26cc-5068-95b9-46f56ade6b07","a7cbaf50-dcc8-5774-8930-1da71b9e3208","98189aa5-5239-52dc-9281-93a3be049729","0e86896e-d133-5315-9fd7-68cc0f021068","21a03c4c-b7e9-50d6-aa18-5e8feeb03ff8"]}]}],"textures":[{"path":"crop_corn.png","name":"crop_corn.png","folder":"","namespace":"","id":"0","width":32,"height":128,"uv_width":32,"uv_height":128,"particle":false,"use_as_default":true,"layers_enabled":false,"sync_to_project":"","render_mode":"default","render_sides":"auto","frame_time":1,"frame_order_type":"loop","frame_order":"","frame_interpolate":false,"visible":true,"internal":true,"saved":true,"uuid":"449c7438-ad5a-5759-b42a-39fab94bf254","relative_path":"crop_corn.png","source":"data:image/png;base64,"}],"animations":[],"description":"# crop_corn\n\nCorn row: tall stalks about 2 m (71 u) when ripe, broad leaves, yellow cobs in husks, tassels on top.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -8..8, y 0..3, z -6..6 units (0.45 x 0.09 x 0.34 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 52.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 16 x 3 x 12 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `seeded` (visible by default): dark tilled ridge with seed holes\n- `sprout`: first green shoots\n- `growing`: half-grown green plants\n- `ripe`: tall stalks with cobs and tassels\n- `harvested`: after harvest\n\n## Notes\n\n- One row segment, 1 column (16 u) long along X, centred on the origin; tile rows side by side every 16 u in Z for a field.\n"}